### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/check/health


### List check items
GET http://localhost:8080/api/check/items


### Retain heap for OOM analysis (controlled 32 MB)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/check/oom?mb=32


### Clear retained OOM simulation heap
GET http://localhost:8080/api/check/oom/clear


### Trigger real heap OOM for MAT heap dump analysis
GET http://localhost:8080/api/check/oom


### Activate member
POST http://localhost:8080/api/member/activate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "device-001",
  "modelCode": "EDU-PAD-2026",
  "userId": "user-001"
}


### Export activation records to xlsx
GET http://localhost:8080/api/member/activation-records/export?modelCode=EDU-PAD-2026&startTime=2026-01-01T00:00:00&endTime=2026-12-31T23:59:59
